Package: linux-image-@REL@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zhongfu <me@zhongfu.li>
Depends: t2-utils, t2-initramfs
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: ZSpace T2 kernel Image and device tree
 The plain arm64 kernel Image and the rk3568-t2 device tree for the ZSpace T2
 (Rockchip RK3568), built from mainline Linux with the board patch set.
 .
 The Image carries no initramfs.  The boot tree - a FAT partition, not the
 rootfs' /boot - gets a FIT (Image + device tree + the initramfs from
 t2-initramfs) that this package's postinst assembles with t2-mkfit, so
 changing the installer inside the initramfs never needs a kernel rebuild.
 .
 The postinst only touches a boot tree when T2_BOOT_DIR names one, so
 installing the package changes nothing outside the rootfs on a board where
 the installer owns the boot tree.  /boot/Image on the rootfs stays plain.
